## Rules

:::decision{#D1 status=superseded} Dual write
DECISION-D1 Write to both ledgers for a week.
:::

:::decision{#D2 status=accepted supersedes=D1 applies-to=R1} Single cutover
DECISION-D2 Switch writes in one step.
:::

:::decision{#D3 status=proposed applies-to=R1} Pause first
DECISION-D3 Pause writes before the switch.
:::

:::decision{#D4 status=accepted} Unlinked choice
DECISION-D4 Use the new region.
:::

## Cutover

:::requirement{#R1 status=accepted} Switch writes
REQ-R1 Point the writer at the new ledger.
:::

